      "side": 1,
      "message": "This is indeed added manually.\n`Fixture` is in e2e_tests and only used in e2e_tests, which are only enabled for x86_64. See https://crosvm.dev/book/testing.html\nSince it\u0027s not supported, we need to add it to `workspace_excludes` to avoid having an Android.bp file generated for it.",
